{"2120430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dungeon Roll", "steam_appid": 2120430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enter the Dungeon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight as a noble crusader, managing mana and skills to carve your way through the dungeons, where each room holds a challange<i> and maybe some secrets.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120430/extras/d4510749bef5e5f81b05d4415874e7ef.poster.avif?t=1785514555\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120430/extras/d4510749bef5e5f81b05d4415874e7ef.webm?t=1785514555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120430/extras/d4510749bef5e5f81b05d4415874e7ef.mp4?t=1785514555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rerun the descent. Reroll your path.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You descend beneath your family estate to uncover the truth about the crusader heroes of your bloodline — rerolling your path floor by floor through a labyrinth built on real Crusades history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120430/extras/5764da87198774f911737e2324a2555e.poster.avif?t=1785514555\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120430/extras/5764da87198774f911737e2324a2555e.webm?t=1785514555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120430/extras/5764da87198774f911737e2324a2555e.mp4?t=1785514555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The dead crusaders remember.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >hunt each sin-boss, and grow strong enough to face the truth about your own bloodline and what's been feeding the dark below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120430/extras/7f6ded83214eced94791b9ca6751f390.poster.avif?t=1785514555\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120430/extras/7f6ded83214eced94791b9ca6751f390.webm?t=1785514555\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120430/extras/7f6ded83214eced94791b9ca6751f390.mp4?t=1785514555\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Complete quests. Unlock the estate's secrets.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finishing quests unlocks new rooms and better rewards on your descent. But beware, some who offer you power are trading in darker strengths, and their gifts come at a price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120430/extras/7520933d14df6ed2d48c0f9c83813402.avif?t=1785514555\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2120430/extras_big/7520933d14df6ed2d48c0f9c83813402.avif?t=1785514555 width=1560 height=874 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enter the Dungeon</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight as a noble crusader, managing mana and skills to carve your way through the dungeons, where each room holds a challange<i> and maybe some secrets.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_c